HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The bbiinnttiimmee functions first appeared in FreeBSD 5.0.  The mmiiccrroottiimmee and
     nnaannoottiimmee functions first appeared in FreeBSD 3.0 but have existed in
     other incarnations since 4.4BSD.

